sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Resident
  participant C as Event card (screen)
  participant H as EventActionsProvider
  participant D as Data layer (events.ts)
  R->>C: Tap "Going"
  C->>H: toggleRsvp(eventId, "going")
  H->>H: Update RSVP state immediately
  H-->>C: Re-render (button filled, count +1)
  H->>D: setRsvp(eventId, "going")
  D-->>H: saved (mock now, database later)
  Note over C,H: Saved tab and Profile stats<br/>read the same shared state
